<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>英文名詞子句 × 間接問句 互動測驗</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;600;900&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1a1209;
    --paper: #faf6ef;
    --cream: #f0e9d8;
    --gold: #c8962a;
    --gold-light: #e8b94a;
    --red: #b83232;
    --green: #2a7a4a;
    --blue: #1e4a8a;
    --shadow: rgba(26,18,9,0.12);
  }

- { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
background: var(–paper);
color: var(–ink);
font-family: ‘Noto Serif TC’, serif;
min-height: 100vh;
background-image:
radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, rgba(200,150,42,0.06) 0%, transparent 50%),
radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 90%, rgba(30,74,138,0.05) 0%, transparent 50%),
url(“data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width=‘60’ height=‘60’ viewBox=‘0 0 60 60’ xmlns=‘http://www.w3.org/2000/svg’%3E%3Cg fill=‘none’ fill-rule=‘evenodd’%3E%3Cg fill=’%23c8962a’ fill-opacity=‘0.03’%3E%3Cpath d=‘M36 34v-4h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2h-4zm0-30V0h-2v4h-4v2h4v4h2V6h4V4h-4zM6 34v-4H4v4H0v2h4v4h2v-4h4v-2H6zM6 4V0H4v4H0v2h4v4h2V6h4V4H6z’/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E”);
}

/* HEADER */
header {
text-align: center;
padding: 56px 24px 40px;
position: relative;
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.3);
}
header::before {
content: ‘’;
display: block;
width: 80px;
height: 3px;
background: var(–gold);
margin: 0 auto 24px;
}
.header-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 4px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold);
margin-bottom: 12px;
}
h1 {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 52px);
font-weight: 700;
line-height: 1.15;
color: var(–ink);
margin-bottom: 12px;
}
h1 em {
font-style: italic;
color: var(–gold);
}
.subtitle {
font-size: 14px;
color: #6b5b3e;
margin-bottom: 24px;
}

/* PROGRESS */
.progress-bar-wrap {
max-width: 500px;
margin: 0 auto;
background: var(–cream);
border-radius: 999px;
height: 6px;
overflow: hidden;
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.2);
}
.progress-bar {
height: 100%;
background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(–gold), var(–gold-light));
border-radius: 999px;
transition: width 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
width: 0%;
}
.progress-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 12px;
color: var(–gold);
margin-top: 8px;
letter-spacing: 1px;
}

/* SCORE BADGE */
.score-display {
display: inline-flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 8px;
background: var(–cream);
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.3);
border-radius: 999px;
padding: 6px 18px;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–ink);
margin-top: 16px;
}
.score-display span { color: var(–gold); font-weight: 500; }

/* MAIN */
main {
max-width: 760px;
margin: 0 auto;
padding: 40px 20px 80px;
}

/* QUESTION CARD */
.question-card {
background: #fff;
border-radius: 2px;
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.2);
box-shadow: 0 4px 24px var(–shadow), 0 1px 3px var(–shadow);
margin-bottom: 32px;
overflow: hidden;
animation: slideIn 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.3,0.64,1) both;
display: none;
}
.question-card.active { display: block; }
@keyframes slideIn {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.card-header {
background: var(–cream);
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.2);
padding: 16px 28px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 12px;
}
.q-number {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 36px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–gold);
line-height: 1;
}
.q-tag {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 2px;
color: #8a7250;
background: rgba(200,150,42,0.1);
border-radius: 2px;
padding: 3px 8px;
text-transform: uppercase;
}

.card-body { padding: 28px 28px 24px; }
.question-text {
font-size: 17px;
line-height: 1.8;
color: var(–ink);
margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.blank {
display: inline-block;
width: 90px;
border-bottom: 2px solid var(–ink);
text-align: center;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
color: var(–gold);
font-weight: 500;
vertical-align: bottom;
margin: 0 4px;
min-height: 22px;
transition: all 0.3s;
}

/* OPTIONS */
.options-grid {
display: grid;
grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
gap: 10px;
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
@media (max-width: 480px) { .options-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.option-btn {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 12px;
padding: 14px 18px;
background: var(–paper);
border: 1.5px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.25);
border-radius: 2px;
cursor: pointer;
font-family: ‘Noto Serif TC’, serif;
font-size: 15px;
color: var(–ink);
transition: all 0.2s;
text-align: left;
}
.option-btn:hover:not(:disabled) {
background: var(–cream);
border-color: var(–gold);
transform: translateX(3px);
}
.option-letter {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 500;
color: var(–gold);
background: rgba(200,150,42,0.12);
border-radius: 2px;
width: 24px;
height: 24px;
display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;
flex-shrink: 0;
}
.option-btn.correct {
background: #edf8f1;
border-color: var(–green);
color: var(–green);
}
.option-btn.correct .option-letter {
background: var(–green);
color: #fff;
}
.option-btn.wrong {
background: #fdf0f0;
border-color: var(–red);
color: var(–red);
text-decoration: line-through;
}
.option-btn.wrong .option-letter {
background: var(–red);
color: #fff;
}
.option-btn.highlight {
background: #edf8f1;
border-color: var(–green);
color: var(–green);
}
.option-btn.highlight .option-letter {
background: var(–green);
color: #fff;
}
.option-btn:disabled { cursor: default; }

/* RESULT PANEL */
.result-panel {
display: none;
margin-top: 20px;
border-top: 1px solid var(–cream);
padding-top: 20px;
animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease both;
}
.result-panel.show { display: block; }
@keyframes fadeUp {
from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.verdict {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 10px;
font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 600;
margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.verdict-icon {
font-size: 22px;
line-height: 1;
}
.verdict.correct-v { color: var(–green); }
.verdict.wrong-v   { color: var(–red); }

.section-label {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 10px;
letter-spacing: 3px;
text-transform: uppercase;
color: var(–gold);
margin-bottom: 6px;
margin-top: 14px;
}
.translation-box {
background: var(–cream);
border-left: 3px solid var(–gold);
padding: 12px 16px;
border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0;
font-size: 15px;
line-height: 1.7;
color: #3a2d1a;
margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.vocab-list {
display: flex;
flex-wrap: wrap;
gap: 8px;
margin-top: 6px;
}
.vocab-chip {
background: rgba(30,74,138,0.07);
border: 1px solid rgba(30,74,138,0.18);
border-radius: 2px;
padding: 5px 12px;
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–blue);
}
.vocab-chip strong {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 12px;
display: block;
color: var(–blue);
margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.analysis-box {
background: #fafafa;
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.2);
border-radius: 2px;
padding: 14px 16px;
font-size: 14px;
line-height: 1.9;
color: #2a2014;
}
.analysis-box .highlight-word {
background: rgba(200,150,42,0.15);
padding: 1px 5px;
border-radius: 2px;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 13px;
color: var(–ink);
}

/* NEXT BUTTON */
.next-btn {
display: none;
margin-top: 20px;
padding: 13px 32px;
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
font-family: ‘Noto Serif TC’, serif;
font-size: 14px;
letter-spacing: 1px;
border: none;
border-radius: 2px;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.2s;
position: relative;
overflow: hidden;
}
.next-btn::after {
content: ’ →’;
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
}
.next-btn:hover {
background: var(–gold);
color: var(–ink);
transform: translateX(4px);
}
.next-btn.show { display: inline-block; }

/* RESULT SCREEN */
#result-screen {
display: none;
text-align: center;
padding: 60px 20px;
animation: slideIn 0.6s ease both;
}
#result-screen.show { display: block; }
.result-trophy {
font-size: 72px;
margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.result-title {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 36px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–ink);
margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.result-score-big {
font-family: ‘Playfair Display’, serif;
font-size: 72px;
font-weight: 700;
color: var(–gold);
line-height: 1;
margin: 16px 0;
}
.result-msg {
font-size: 16px;
color: #5a4a30;
margin-bottom: 32px;
line-height: 1.7;
}
.retry-btn {
padding: 14px 40px;
background: var(–gold);
color: var(–ink);
font-family: ‘Noto Serif TC’, serif;
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 600;
border: none;
border-radius: 2px;
cursor: pointer;
transition: all 0.2s;
letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.retry-btn:hover {
background: var(–ink);
color: var(–paper);
transform: scale(1.03);
}
.result-table {
max-width: 500px;
margin: 32px auto;
text-align: left;
border-collapse: collapse;
font-size: 14px;
}
.result-table th {
background: var(–cream);
padding: 10px 16px;
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.2);
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 11px;
letter-spacing: 2px;
color: var(–gold);
text-transform: uppercase;
}
.result-table td {
padding: 10px 16px;
border: 1px solid rgba(200,150,42,0.12);
vertical-align: middle;
}
.result-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: var(–paper); }
.correct-mark { color: var(–green); font-size: 16px; }
.wrong-mark   { color: var(–red);   font-size: 16px; }

/* DECORATIVE */
.deco-line {
display: flex;
align-items: center;
gap: 12px;
margin: 24px 0;
opacity: 0.4;
}
.deco-line::before, .deco-line::after {
content: ‘’;
flex: 1;
height: 1px;
background: var(–gold);
}
.deco-line span {
font-family: ‘DM Mono’, monospace;
font-size: 14px;
color: var(–gold);
}
</style>

</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="header-label">Grammar Quiz · 文法測驗</div>
  <h1>名詞子句 &amp; <em>間接問句</em></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Noun Clauses · Indirect Questions · 共 25 題</p>
  <div class="progress-bar-wrap">
    <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="progress-label" id="progressLabel">0 / 25</div>
  <div class="score-display">得分 <span id="liveScore">0</span> / <span id="liveDone">0</span></div>
</header>

<main id="quizArea">
  <!-- Questions injected by JS -->
</main>

<div id="result-screen">
  <div class="result-trophy" id="trophyEmoji">🏆</div>
  <div class="result-title">測驗完成！</div>
  <div class="result-score-big" id="finalScore"></div>
  <div class="result-msg" id="finalMsg"></div>
  <table class="result-table" id="resultTable">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>#</th><th>題目摘要</th><th>你的答案</th><th>正解</th><th>結果</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody id="resultBody"></tbody>
  </table>
  <button class="retry-btn" onclick="restartQuiz()">🔄 重新測驗</button>
</div>

<script>
const questions = [
  {
    q: "Willy found ______ the novel he bought last week was under his bed.",
    options: ["that","where","whether","which"],
    answer: 0,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "威利發現他上週買的那本小說在他的床下。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "novel", def: "小說（n.）" },
      { word: "found", def: "發現（v.）find的過去式" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>found</span> 後接名詞子句表示「發現某事」，子句內容為確定事實，用 <span class='highlight-word'>that</span> 引導。where（地點）、whether（是否）、which（哪個）皆不合語意。`
  },
  {
    q: "Jacky would like to bring that poor dog back home, but he isn't sure ______ his mother likes dogs.",
    options: ["how","what","whether","which"],
    answer: 2,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "傑奇想把那隻可憐的狗帶回家，但他不確定他媽媽是否喜歡狗。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "whether", def: "是否（conj.）" },
      { word: "isn't sure", def: "不確定（片語）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>isn't sure</span> 後接名詞子句，表「不確定是否…」，用 <span class='highlight-word'>whether</span>（= if）。how（如何）、what（什麼）、which（哪個）均不符合「是否」之語意。`
  },
  {
    q: "A-fen: Yes, I'm not sure ______ we can still go fishing tomorrow.",
    options: ["who","what","which","whether"],
    answer: 3,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "阿芬：是啊，我不確定我們明天是否還能去釣魚。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "whether", def: "是否（conj.）" },
      { word: "go fishing", def: "去釣魚（片語）" },
      { word: "typhoon", def: "颱風（n.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `語境為颱風天，阿芬表示「不確定是否能去」，<span class='highlight-word'>I'm not sure</span> 後接名詞子句，用 <span class='highlight-word'>whether</span>（是否）。`
  },
  {
    q: "Alice learned from the TV news ______ Nora Jones was coming to Taiwan the next day.",
    options: ["that","where","which","whether"],
    answer: 0,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "愛麗絲從電視新聞得知諾拉瓊斯隔天將來台灣。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "learned", def: "得知；學到（v.）" },
      { word: "the next day", def: "隔天（片語）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>learned from the TV news</span> 後接名詞子句，說明得知的「內容」，內容是確定的新聞事實，用 <span class='highlight-word'>that</span> 引導。`
  },
  {
    q: "I'm not sure if Kevin ______ this morning, but if he does, I'll tell him that you called. 【103教育會考】",
    options: ["will come in","comes in","has come in","came in"],
    answer: 1,
    tag: "時態",
    translation: "我不確定凱文今天早上是否會進來，但如果他來，我會告訴他你打過電話。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "come in", def: "進來；到達（片語動詞）" },
      { word: "if", def: "是否；如果（conj.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `關鍵在後半句 <span class='highlight-word'>if he does</span>，does 為現在簡單式，與前面的 <span class='highlight-word'>comes in</span> 呼應，表達未來條件用現在式。此為【103教育會考】真題。`
  },
  {
    q: "My father told me last night ______ we're going to the Food Festival this weekend. My brother and I felt very excited.",
    options: ["whether","where","what","that"],
    answer: 3,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "我父親昨晚告訴我們這週末要去美食節。我哥哥和我都感到非常興奮。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "Food Festival", def: "美食節（n.）" },
      { word: "excited", def: "興奮的（adj.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>told me</span> 後接名詞子句說明告知的「內容」，是確定的計畫，用 <span class='highlight-word'>that</span>。whether 表「不確定」，與語意不符。`
  },
  {
    q: "I was surprised to know from the newspaper yesterday ______ flowers do not always smell sweet; some can smell like dead fish.",
    options: ["that","when","where","which"],
    answer: 0,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "我昨天從報紙得知，花朵並不總是香的；有些聞起來像死魚。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "surprised", def: "驚訝的（adj.）" },
      { word: "smell like", def: "聞起來像（片語）" },
      { word: "dead fish", def: "死魚（n.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>surprised to know</span> 後接名詞子句說明得知的內容，用 <span class='highlight-word'>that</span>。後面是陳述事實，不含疑問語氣。`
  },
  {
    q: "Jerry wanted to know ______ he was kicked off the soccer team, but no one gave him a good reason.",
    options: ["where","when","whether","why"],
    answer: 3,
    tag: "間接問句",
    translation: "傑瑞想知道他為什麼被踢出足球隊，但沒有人給他一個好的理由。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "kick off", def: "踢出；開除（片語動詞）" },
      { word: "reason", def: "理由；原因（n.）" },
      { word: "soccer team", def: "足球隊（n.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `後半句 <span class='highlight-word'>no one gave him a good reason</span> 暗示他想知道的是「原因」，所以用 <span class='highlight-word'>why</span> 引導間接問句。`
  },
  {
    q: "Do you know ______ the last bus leaves tonight?",
    options: ["that","what time","whether","which"],
    answer: 1,
    tag: "間接問句",
    translation: "你知道今晚最後一班公車幾點出發嗎？",
    vocab: [
      { word: "last bus", def: "末班公車（n.）" },
      { word: "leave", def: "出發；離開（v.）" },
      { word: "what time", def: "幾點（疑問詞片語）" }
    ],
    analysis: `詢問時間，用 <span class='highlight-word'>what time</span> 引導間接問句，語序須改為陳述句順序（what time + S + V）。`
  },
  {
    q: "She didn't tell us ______ she would join the party or not.",
    options: ["that","what","whether","who"],
    answer: 2,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "她沒有告訴我們她是否會參加派對。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "join", def: "參加（v.）" },
      { word: "party", def: "派對（n.）" },
      { word: "whether...or not", def: "是否（固定用法）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>whether...or not</span> 是固定用法，表示「是否」。此句意思為「是否會參加」，whether 最合適，且 or not 更強化了不確定性。`
  },
  {
    q: "I wonder ______ Tom passed the math exam.",
    options: ["that","if","what","where"],
    answer: 1,
    tag: "名詞子句",
    translation: "我很好奇湯姆是否通過了數學考試。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "wonder", def: "感到好奇；想知道（v.）" },
      { word: "pass", def: "通過（v.）" },
      { word: "math exam", def: "數學考試（n.）" }
    ],
    analysis: `<span class='highlight-word'>wonder</span> 後接名詞子句，表示「不確定是否」，用 <span class='highlight-word'>if</span>（= whether）。that 用於確定內容，不合語意。`
  },
  {
    q: "The teacher asked the students ______ they had finished their homework.",
    options: ["that","what","whether","which"],
    answer: 2,
    tag: "間接問句",
    translation: "老師問學生們是否已經完成了作業。",
    vocab: [
      { word: "asked", def: "詢問（v.）" },
      { word: "finish", def: "完成（v.）" },
      { word: "homework", def: "作業（n.）" }
    ],
